  "keyFeatures": [
    "Full TypeScript support with generic type parameters for documents and user preferences",
    "Covers all Appwrite services: Auth, Databases, Storage, Functions, Messaging, Teams, Sites, Health",
    "Built-in chunked file uploads with progress callbacks",
    "Powerful Query builder with filtering, sorting, pagination, and geospatial support",
    "Role and Permission helpers for fine-grained access control",
    "BigInt support for large integer values via json-bigint",
    "User impersonation support for admin workflows",
    "Works across Node.js, Deno, and WinterCG-compatible edge runtimes"
  ],
